{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id39198884"}, "name":{"label":"Memsom"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-30T02:35:14-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.8.0"}, "id":{"label":"14489250662"}, "title":{"label":"Inaccurate"}, "content":{"label":"My partner has been complaining that Carrot is inaccurate when compared to Weather and BBC Weather. So I installed it and we compared what the values for today in the exact same location were. Completely different results. In every list of values, hers diverged from mine. Which is insane. How can we rely on this now?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id41015457"}, "name":{"label":"Emma......."}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-19T22:41:37-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.8.0"}, "id":{"label":"14449584775"}, "title":{"label":"Trim and focus and make it cheaper"}, "content":{"label":"I literally just did a review then an app update came through stripping even more features!\n\nI’ve had this now for a couple of years, pay the price as it makes me smile. I pay £19.49 a year, now, for the weather, something readily available for free from lots of places, so that’s a lot!\nI’ve watched the app get stuffed with unnecessary features, get messy, and slowly things getting stripped away for ‘ultra’ even basic things or just handy things like Apple car play. Now that the edge of the comedy aspect and pretty graphics is wearing off this is beginning to really annoy me, the weather accuracy has also gotten worse and having just done the app update you’ve stripped away multi day on the sonar, what next! I mean, come on. \nSo, I’ll give it 6 months, I hope you’re the type of developers that look at reviews and take on board the criticism from your loyal customers … whether you act on it is your choice, but I will be cancelling and deleting if things don’t improve.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id497805230"}, "name":{"label":"This.is.the.wayyy"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-10T14:53:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.8.0"}, "id":{"label":"14412123332"}, "title":{"label":"Fantastic weather app"}, "content":{"label":"It’s one of the best weather apps ever. My husband, son and I have used Carrot for almost a year. It works great, adds humour to checking the weather and is always accurate, but for a family subscription it’s too expensive. Please can you look at reducing it slightly,  even if only £10 less? Regardless, thank you dev for the awesome work on Carrot", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
