{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id42270450"}, "name":{"label":"marcdraco"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-25T23:08:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.7"}, "id":{"label":"14349192781"}, "title":{"label":"Brilliant but overpriced"}, "content":{"label":"I’d love to say it’s worth the price and there’s no doubt the app goes an extra mile but the problem is that it’s a one-trick pony that (on the “free” version spends more time bugging you to buy the upgrade than it does proving useful information. \n\nIt does smell more strongly of AI now than I remember;  I’ve been dropping in and out since the early days.\n\nSo yeah, still great fun, but that doesn’t come close to justifying the price or the adverts to buy it. \n\nAnd since licensing is clearly a “moving target” these days, I refuse to take anything anyone says up front.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
