{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id712713013"}, "name":{"label":"JacobEW98"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-15T00:35:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.5"}, "id":{"label":"14066259079"}, "title":{"label":"Fun & Unique / can be inaccurate and nonsensical"}, "content":{"label":"Overall, I love the app. It’s lots of fun being able to find the achievements, track the highest temperatures you’ve experienced etc, and the overall customisation. But the accuracy seems off, even within the same source. It’ll say possible rain in the next hour but when I check the precip chance for the next 4 hours, it’ll say 0%; it doesn’t line up. Even if I have a specific source set up, it often gives me a slightly different forecast to that source’s dedicated app/website. This needs fixing.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
