{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1534173615"}, "name":{"label":"alex. 🍎"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-20T10:10:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.3.3"}, "id":{"label":"13656199263"}, "title":{"label":"Hands down the best weather app"}, "content":{"label":"Really is just a great app, and much better than any other weather app I’ve ever used.\n\nThere’s so much customisation available (with premium), you can change the personality of the app, the layout, the weather source, etc etc.\n\nThe only negative thing I can say is that for my use case, premium is a necessity. You might be fine without it, but it doesn’t do everything I want if I don’t subscribe. There’s currently two premium plans, I use the cheaper one of around £20/year, but the other one is around double that.\n\nStill an amazing app, and personally happy to pay for it, but something to be aware of if you can’t/don’t want to.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
